@Espilonarge
I would say that my script has different functions and features, many of them being exclusive and advanced, such as fast graphics processing, custom blending, dynamic shadows, soft shadows, etc. And because of the way they were implemented, I can't add wave effect or light stretching, for example (performance reasons). Also, I'm not familiar with the script you said, so I can't say which features it has in common with mine.
The demo demonstrates almost all features my script has, so I recommend to study it carefully. With some creativity you can use them to make unique stuff (for example, you could use light grouping to make a fade in-fade out effect).

