@Kes
the string passed to set_battle_lighting refers to the scene name, not to the light itself. So you must have it defined in the battle lighting add-on, like this:
Code:
"simple" => {
    :color => Color.new(0,0,0),
    :opacity => 150,
    :lights => [
      ["simple", 180, 248],
      ["simple", 364, 248]
    ]
  },

